# OBOROZUKI MANOR 1F -- Kagura Hall (dance stage)   (10x9, TILESET_TRADITIONAL_HOUSE, ref DanceTheater)
# Private copy of the Dance Theater: shoji backdrop, raised wooden stage (2c) with stage steps at both
# ends (2e/2f), audience tatami with cushions, earth strip and mats at the bottom.
# Gameplay: the family's own Kimono Girl quartet ("Four Moons") stands on the stage. Beat all four in
# a row (no healing between, like the Dance Theater event) -> the Lead Dancer gives the MOON FAN,
# which unlocks the study bookshelf later. A patron NPC in the audience explains the eclipse dance.
# Warps: HALL mats (9,17)(10,17) -> Engawa east carpet (39,6).
